1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,400
Thousands of tasks.
Few will ship.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,100
Scout finds the work.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,700
Planner cuts it small.

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,300
Builder writes the change.

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:11,900
Reviewer and tester
are gates.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
What passes ships
at one point.

7
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:21,900
A gate holds what fails.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,600
Reviewer off.
More ships. More reverts.

9
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,500
Gate back on.
Fewer reverts.

10
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,000
Next: add one gate
to yours.
